  "id": "nord-c1",
  "name": "Nord C1",
  "manufacturer": "Nord",
  "family": "Organ",
  "status": "experimental",
  "trust": "local",
  "description": "Nord C1 combo organ: every control of its manual's MIDI controller list, each on the channels its comment column names.",
  "sources": [
    {
      "type": "manual",
      "title": "Nord C1 User Manual, OS v1.0x",
      "notes": "MIDI controller list (page 17 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/nord/read-nord-cc.mjs from Nord C1 English User Manual v1.0x Edition 1.x.pdf (sha256 d5434cb567eaa61ef3fbcd20c7c16b7f9b220ab3b0bfa6315f1b2e3e437a4dea), https://www.nordkeyboards.com/wt/documents/180/Nord%20C1%20English%20User%20Manual%20v1.0x%20Edition%201.x.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."
    }
  ],
  "testedWith": [],
  "authoringNotes": [
    "Generated by tools/profiles/nord/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/nord/synths/, not this file.",
    "Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI controller list, with its printed name, sent as the control change it prints on the channel of each manual it is on. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.",
    "The list prints controller numbers only: every value is 0 - 127, and a setting chosen from a list (a model, a waveform, an effect type) is a number here, not a choice.",
    "The channel variables are the Upper, Lower and Bass MIDI channels (the System menu); 1, 2 and 3 here, which may not be the instrument's.",
    "Left out, the pedals, the wheel and bank select: 4 Swell pedal, 64 Sustain pedal."
  ],
  "variables": {
    "channel": 1,
    "lowerChannel": 2,
    "bassChannel": 3
  },
  "coverage": {
    "singleParameterWrite": "complete-for-the-manual's-MIDI-controller-list",
